    Bug 1924778 - Move preparing URIs for channels to a util method of EwsService. r=leftmostcat


    While giving D226396 a test run, I realised the URIs that are used to copy
    messages are using a different format than the ones the channel expect.

    `LoadMessage` also faces this issue, so this patch takes the URI
    generation/mutation out of it and into a method that D226396 can use.

    Differential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D226472

